Spec: PM4ADDA accumulating multiply-add instructions perform read-modify-write on rd; incorrect aliasing to non-accumulating PM4ADD overwrite variants silently discards prior rd state, causing data corruption.
  [RISK] arch/riscv/kvm/vcpu_insn.c:328-359  kvm_riscv_vcpu_virtual_insn
